                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9866c49d-86f7-43f2-8402-24ecfd67ff20",
                                "sense_id": "5aac4e5f-28a7-3a96-b96c-7c0c6c6a43b2",
                                "text": "For in the tenth year, when roy victory / Was won to give the Greeks the spoil of Troy, / Return they did profess, but not enjoy, / Since Pallas they incens'd, and she the waves / By all the winds' power, that blew ope their graves."
